<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Student hostel allocation and roommate compatibility portal">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#18322b"><title>SmartHostel | University accommodation</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css"><script src="/assets/app.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="top"><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">S</span> SmartHostel</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#hostels">About</a><a href="#app">Portal</a><button id="account" class="button secondary" type="button">Sign in</button></nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main"><div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="false"></div>
    <section id="home" class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">University accommodation portal</p><h1>Find your place.<br><em>Find your people.</em></h1><p class="lead">A fair, transparent way to discover compatible roommates and secure an eligible university bed space.</p><button class="button" id="get-started" type="button">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><a class="text-link" href="#how">Explore the process</a></div>
      <div class="hero-card" aria-label="Roommate compatibility"><div class="sun" aria-hidden="true">✳</div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>Good living<br>starts with<br>a good match.</h2><div class="minirow"><span class="avatars" aria-hidden="true">A · Z</span><span><b>Compatibility</b><br>Built around your habits</span></div></div>
    </section>
    <section id="how" class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A simple four-step journey</p><h2>From preferences to<br>a place of your own.</h2></div><p>Thoughtful matching first. A secure, time-limited reservation when you’re ready.</p></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Get verified</h3><p>Create your student profile and submit your school-fee reference for review.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Find your match</h3><p>Share the way you like to live. See ranked recommendations from your answers.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Choose your space</h3><p>Explore eligible beds, then place a 48-hour hold on the one you want.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Confirm your stay</h3><p>Submit payment details for review. Allocation follows verified payment.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="app" class="app-section" aria-labelledby="view-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your campus, your way</p><h2 id="view-title">Welcome to SmartHostel</h2></div><p id="view-sub">Sign in or create an account to get started.</p></div><div class="actions" id="global-actions" hidden><button id="cancel-hold" class="button secondary" type="button">Cancel my active hold</button></div><div id="view" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false"></div></section>
    <section id="hostels" class="section hostels"><p class="eyebrow">Made for campus life</p><h2>More than a room.<br>A place to thrive.</h2><p>Clear availability, fair eligibility checks, and roommate recommendations that make sense.</p></section>
  </main>
  <footer><a class="brand" href="#home">SmartHostel</a><span>Student accommodation, made more thoughtful.</span><span>Payment review is currently handled in development mode.</span></footer>
  <dialog id="auth-dialog" aria-label="Account sign in or registration"><button class="close" type="button" aria-label="Close dialog">×</button><div id="auth-content"></div></dialog>
